        {
          "id": "about",
          "type": "story",
          "variant": "split",
          "content": {
            "eyebrow": "Our Story",
            "title": "Built around one honest bowl",
            "paragraphs": [
              "Verdant began with a single counter, one blender and a market stall's worth of vegetables. We wanted a lunch that tasted like a farm stand but moved like a fast-food line: real produce, cooked that morning, in and out in five minutes.",
              "Today every kitchen still cooks from scratch, the menu still follows the harvest, and every bowl is built the moment you order it. Six neighbourhood kitchens, one short ingredient list, and no shortcuts we would have to explain."
            ],
            "media": {
              "kind": "image",
              "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464226184884-fa280b87c399?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=900&q=75",
